# Entries the ensure script asserts in zapret's exclude list, one per line.
#   +name  keep present and active
#   -name  keep out of the way: an active line gets commented out
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# + duolingo.com, duolingo.cn
#   Alibaba-hosted endpoints (tts-static.duolingo.cn, simg-ssl.duolingo.cn)
#   answer a split ClientHello with a TLS alert or plaintext instead of a
#   handshake, so desync has to skip them.
#
# + stepfun.ai
#   Already shipped in the router's list at line 2; kept here so a list update
#   that drops it is repaired.
#
# + Alipay group, measured 2026-10-10 from a client behind the router.
#   With desync applied these answered with a TLS protocol error
#   (UNSOLICITED_EXTENSION, INVALID_SESSION_ID) or a reset; with the name
#   excluded they handshake. antgroup.com on the same address 110.75.130.45 was
#   the control that handshook while its neighbours did not. Several now fail
#   only certificate verification, which is the hostname not being covered by
#   the leaf - the handshake itself completes.
#
#   Tried and dropped, because they time out with desync applied AND with the
#   name excluded, so an entry buys nothing either way: alipay.net, alipay.hk,
#   alipay-eco.com, myalicdn.com, ialicdn.com, alibaba.com, alibaba-inc.com,
#   ifaa.org.cn, sinopayment.com.cn. Those need the routing lever (the foreign
#   VPN list), not this one.
#
# - cloudfront.net
#   The Duolingo web app's audio CDNs (d1vq87e9lcf771, d2pur3iezf4d1j,
#   d1btvuu4dwu627) need the bypass the ISP SNI filter denies them, so the
#   catch-all that would shield them stays inactive. An older repo copy of the
#   exclude list claims this line is load-bearing because a trailing
#   --hostlist-domains profile names those three hosts; that profile is not in
#   /etc/config/zapret any more, so the catch-all is what carries them now.

+duolingo.com
+duolingo.cn
+stepfun.ai
+alipay.com
+alipay.cn
+alipay.com.cn
+alipayobjects.com
+alipayplus.com
+alipaydev.com
+alipay-inc.com
+alipay-corp.com
+alipay-traffic.com
+alipaydesign.com
+alipaydns.com
+alipayeshop.com
+alipaylog.com
+alipaymo.com
-cloudfront.net
